<title>USA: TABLE - Eagle USA Airfreight Inc Q3 shr up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Eagle USA Airfreight Inc Q3 shr up.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					    Three Months  Nine Months</p>
<p>					 Ended June 30,  Ended June 30,</p>
<p>				     1997	1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Revenues			$71,301  $48,240 $200,376 $127,989</p>
<p> Cost of transportation     39,981   27,016  112,858   71,402</p>
<p>   Total			  31,320   21,224   87,518   56,587</p>
